            "description": "<p>Creates a replication subnet group given a list of the subnet IDs in a VPC.</p> <p>The VPC needs to have at least one subnet in at least two availability zones in the Amazon Web Services Region, otherwise the service will throw a <code>ReplicationSubnetGroupDoesNotCoverEnoughAZs</code> exception.</p>"
